{"candidate_id":"figure-analysis:Figure2:41895c5b49b3d9b0","artifact_id":"Figure2","visual_type":"flowchart","description":"Eevee’s framework has an inference pipeline and a co-evolution system. Inference sends an input through a router to a target model and output. Co-evolution alternates router evolution and prompt evolution: training data is sampled and grouped, the router is updated, and grouped data updates the prompt set. A learning loop generates candidates through mutation, scoring, reflection, and adding better candidates.","components":[{"name":"Input","role":"inference input","visual_evidence":"Shown at the top of the left Inference panel."},{"name":"Router","role":"routes inputs to specialized prompts","visual_evidence":"Shown between Input and Target Model with a downward arrow from Input."},{"name":"Target Model","role":"produces model responses","visual_evidence":"Shown below Router in the Inference panel."},{"name":"Output","role":"inference result","visual_evidence":"Shown at the bottom of the Inference panel."},{"name":"Training Data (Q&A Pairs)","role":"data source for co-evolution","visual_evidence":"Cylinder/database icons labeled Training Data (Q&A Pairs) appear in Router Evolution and Learning Loop."},{"name":"Router Evolution","role":"updates the router","visual_evidence":"Yellow panel containing Router, Sample, Learning Loop, and Updated Router."},{"name":"Grouped Training Data","role":"router-routed training data","visual_evidence":"Grouped table icons appear below Grouping and point toward Prompt Evolution."},{"name":"Prompt Evolution","role":"updates the prompt set","visual_evidence":"Pink panel containing Prompt Set, Learning Loop, and Updated Prompt Set."},{"name":"Prompt Set","role":"specialized prompts","visual_evidence":"Document-stack icon labeled Prompt Set appears at the top of Prompt Evolution."},{"name":"Updated Prompt Set","role":"evolved prompts","visual_evidence":"Document-stack icon labeled Updated Prompt Set appears at the 